lls act as placement markers.\n    markers = [(y,x) for comp in comps if comp is not motif for y,x,v in comp]\n    out = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    for y,x in markers:\n        top, left = y-anchor_r, x-anchor_c\n        for dy,dx,v in shape:\n            yy,xx = top+dy,left+dx\n            if 0 <= yy < h and 0 <= xx < w:\n                out[yy][xx] = v\n    return out\n```\n{\"action\":\"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit"}}]}